 so that attributions no longer need to be displayed on the shirt. Unfortunately, for various reasons I can't have the group order sent to my house. Does anyone want to handle distributing the t-shirts?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe other option is to set up a 0 profit fundraiser, but I think we will need a minimum of 50 shirt requests for that, not sure if there is that much demand.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnyway, \u003ca href=\"http://www.customink.com/designs/iotsucks2/pqs0-00af-n865/twt\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehere is the shirt\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"I have finished the IoT t-shirt, taking care of things so that attributions no longer need to be displayed on the shirt. Unfortunately, for various reasons I can't have the group order sent to my house. Does anyone want to handle distributing the t-shirts?\r\n\r\nThe other option is to set up a 0 profit fundraiser, but I think we will need a minimum of 50 shirt requests for that, not sure if there is that much demand.\r\n\r\nAnyway, [here is the shirt](http://www.customink.com/designs/iotsucks2/pqs0-00af-n865/twt).","submitter_user":"flyingfisch","user_is_author":true,"tags":["show"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/a3fhgi","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/a3fhgi/iot_shirt_final"},{"short_id":"kz6drt","created_at":"2016-02-29T13:45:20.000-06:00","title":"See That Billboard? It May See You, Too","url":"http://www.nytimes.com/2016/02/29/business/media/see-that-billboard-it-may-see-you-too.html","score":1,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"pushcx","user_is_author":false,"tags":["privacy"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/kz6drt","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/kz6drt/see_billboard_it_may_see_you_too"},{"short_id":"cqzi4b","created_at":"2016-02-29T13:26:10.000-06:00","title":"State of the Art JavaScript in 2016","url":"https://medium.com/@fward/state-of-the-art-javascript-in-2016-ab67fc68eb0b","score":14,"flags":0,"comment_cou